Implemented all required artifacts:

- [solution.py](/work/solution.py) and generated [solution.mpy](/work/solution.mpy)
- [semantic.k](/work/semantic.k)
- [verification.k](/work/verification.k)
- [spec.k](/work/spec.k)
- Executable [prove.sh](/work/prove.sh)

Concrete `krun` cases covered all prompt examples, no-even input, and equal-value tie-breaking. The universal finite-array proof printed `#Top` and exited 0.

